        <h2 class="h-display" data-split>Better <em>together.</em></h2>
        <p class="body-copy">Real systems rarely pick one database. Martin Fowler popularised the term <strong>polyglot persistence</strong>: each part of an application uses the store that suits its data. Select a service.</p>
